== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(þrír)|fjörutíu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[þrír]]'' "[[three]]". Meaning '''forty and three'''.
